<span id="Part_tools_toolbar"></span>
=== Лента Инструменти Част ===

* [[Image:Sketcher_NewSketch.svg|32px]] [[Sketcher_NewSketch/bg|Нова скица]]: Създава нова скица и отваря [[Sketcher_Dialog/bg|Диалог Sketcher]], за да я редактира.

* [[Image:Part_Extrude.svg|32px]] [[Part_Extrude/bg|Екструдиране]]: Екструдира равнинни лица.

* [[Image:Part_Revolve.svg|32px]] [[Part_Revolve|Ротационно тяло]]: Създава твърдо тяло чрез въртене на обект (не твърдо тяло) около ос.

* [[Image:Part_Mirror.svg|32px]] [[Part_Mirror|Отражение]]: Отразява огледално избрания обект през огледална равнина.

* [[Image:Part_Scale.svg|32px]] [[Part_Scale|Мащаб]]: Мащабира една или повече форми. {{Version|1.0}}

* [[Image:Part_Fillet.svg|32px]] [[Part_Fillet|Закръгляване]]: Заобля (закръгля) ръбове на обект.

* [[Image:Part_Chamfer.svg|32px]] [[Part_Chamfer|Скосяване]]: Скосява ръбове на обект.

* [[File:Part_MakeFace.svg|32px]] [[Part_MakeFace|Лице от линии]]: Прави лице от набор от линии (контури).

* [[Image:Part_RuledSurface.svg|32px]] [[Part_RuledSurface|Направлявана повърхност]]: Създава направлявана от две криви повърхност.

* [[Image:Part_Loft.svg|32px]] [[Part_Loft|Преливане]]: Създава повърхнина преливаща между зададени профили.

* [[Image:Part_Sweep.svg|32px]] [[Part_Sweep|Изтегляне по път]]: Изтегля един или повече профили по път.

* [[Image:Part_Section.svg|32px]] [[Part_Section|Сеченение]]: Създава нова крива по пресечницата на два обекта.

* [[Image:Part_CrossSections.svg|32px]] [[Part_CrossSections|Напречни сечения]]: Създава едно или повече напречни сечения през даден обект.

* <span id="Part_CompOffsetTools">[[Image:Part_Offset.svg|x32px]][[Image:Toolbar_flyout_arrow_blue_background.svg|x32px]] Отместване:</span><!--Do not edit span id: the Part_CompOffsetTools pages redirect here-->

:* [[Image:Part_Offset.svg|32px]] [[Part_Offset|3D Offset]]: Изгражда паралелна форма на определено разстояние от оригинал.

:* [[Image:Part_Offset2D.svg|32px]] [[Part_Offset2D|2D Offset]]: Изгражда паралелна мрежа линии на определено разстояние от оригинал или уголемява/свива равнинно лице.

* [[Image:Part_Thickness.svg|32px]] [[Part_Thickness/bg|Дебелина]]: Издълбава вътрешността на избраното твърдо тяло.

* [[File:Part_ProjectionOnSurface.svg|32px]] [[Part_ProjectionOnSurface/bg|Проектиране върху повърхност]]: Проектира лого, текст или всяко лице, линия или ръб върху повърхност.

* [[File:Part_ColorPerFace.svg|32px]] [[Part_ColorPerFace|Външен вид според лицето]]: Присвоява цветове на отделни лица на предмети.

<span id="Boolean_toolbar"></span>
=== Лента Булеви инструменти ===

* <span id="Part_CompCompoundTools">[[Image:Part_Compound.svg|x32px]][[Image:Toolbar_flyout_arrow_blue_background.svg|x32px]] Съединение:</span><!--Do not edit span id: the Part_CompCompoundTools pages redirect here-->

:* [[Image:Part_Compound.svg|32px]] [[Part_Compound/bg|Съединениe]]: Създава съединение от избраните обекти.

:* [[Image:Part_ExplodeCompound.svg|32px]] [[Part_ExplodeCompound/bg|Разпадане на съединение]]: Разпада съединения.

:* [[Image:Part_CompoundFilter.svg|32px]] [[Part_CompoundFilter|Compound Filter]]: Extracts the individual pieces from compounds.

* <span id="Part_LinkArrays">[[Image:Part_LinkArrayLinear.svg|32px]][[Image:Toolbar_flyout_arrow_blue_background.svg|x32px]] Свързани масиви:</span><!--Do not edit span id: the Part_LinkArrays pages redirect here-->

:* [[Image:Part_LinkArrayLinear.svg|32px]] [[Part_LinkArrayLinear/bg|Линеен свързан масив]]: Създава [[App_Link|Link]] масив от избран обект, като поставя копия в линеен модел по една или две избрани посоки. {{Version|26.3}}

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
:* [[Image:Part_LinkArrayPolar.svg|32px]] [[Part_LinkArrayPolar|Polar Link Array]]: Creates a [[App_Link|Link]] array from a selected object by placing copies in a polar pattern about a selected axis. {{Version|26.3}}
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
:* [[Image:Part_LinkArrayCircular.svg|32px]] [[Part_LinkArrayCircular|Circular Link Array]]: Creates a [[App_Link|Link]] array from a selected object by placing copies along concentric circles. {{Version|26.3}}
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
:* [[Image:Part_LinkArrayPath.svg|32px]] [[Part_LinkArrayPath|Path Link Array]]: Creates a [[App_Link|Link]] array from a selected object by placing copies along a path. {{Version|26.3}}
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
:* [[Image:Part_LinkArrayPoint.svg|32px]] [[Part_LinkArrayPoint|Point Link Array]]: Creates a [[App_Link|Link]] array from a selected object by placing copies at the points of a selected shape. {{Version|26.3}}
</div>

* [[Image:Part_Boolean.svg|32px]] [[Part_Boolean|Булеви операции]]: Performs boolean operations on two objects.

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* [[Image:Part_Cut.svg|32px]] [[Part_Cut|Cut]]: Cuts one object from another.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* [[Image:Part_Fuse.svg|32px]] [[Part_Fuse|Union]]: Fuses two or more objects.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* [[Image:Part_Common.svg|32px]] [[Part_Common|Intersection]]: Extracts the common part of two objects.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* <span id="Part_CompJoinFeatures">[[Image:Part_JoinConnect.svg|x32px]][[Image:Toolbar_flyout_arrow_blue_background.svg|x32px]] Join:</span><!--Do not edit span id: the Part_CompJoinFeatures pages redirect here-->
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
:* [[Image:Part_JoinConnect.svg|32px]] [[Part_JoinConnect|Connect Shapes]]: Connects interiors of walled objects.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
:* [[Image:Part_JoinEmbed.svg|32px]] [[Part_JoinEmbed|Embed Shapes]]: Embeds a walled object into another walled object.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
:* [[Image:Part_JoinCutout.svg|32px]] [[Part_JoinCutout|Cutout Shape]]: Creates a cutout in a wall of an object for another walled object.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* <span id="Part_CompSplittingTools">[[Image:Part_BooleanFragments.svg|x32px]][[Image:Toolbar_flyout_arrow_blue_background.svg|x32px]] Split:</span><!--Do not edit span id: the Part_CompSplittingTools pages redirect here-->
</div>

:* [[Image:Part_BooleanFragments.svg|32px]] [[Part_BooleanFragments/bg|Булеви фрагменти]]: Създава всички парчета, получени от булеви операции.

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
:* [[Image:Part SliceApart.svg|32px]] [[Part_SliceApart|Slice Apart]]: Slices and splits an object by intersecting it with other objects.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
:* [[Image:Part_Slice.svg|32px]] [[Part_Slice|Slice to Compound]]: Slices an object by intersecting it with other objects.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
:* [[Image:Part_XOR.svg|32px]] [[Part_XOR|Boolean XOR]]: Removes space shared by an even number of objects.
</div>

* [[File:Part_CheckGeometry.svg|32px]] [[Part_CheckGeometry/bg|Проверка на геометрията]]: Проверява геометрията на избрани обекти за грешки.

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* [[Image:Part Defeaturing.svg|32px]] [[Part_Defeaturing|Defeaturing]]: Removes features from an object.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
=== Other tools ===
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* [[File:Part_BoxSelection.svg|32px]] [[Part_BoxSelection|Box Selection]]: Selects faces from a rectangular area.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* [[File:Part_ShapeFromMesh.svg|32px]] [[Part_ShapeFromMesh|Shape From Mesh]]: Creates shapes from mesh objects.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* [[File:Part_PointsFromMesh.svg|32px]] [[Part_PointsFromMesh|Points From Shape]]: Creates points objects from geometric objects.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* [[File:Part_MakeSolid.svg|32px]] [[Part_MakeSolid|Convert to Solid]]: Creates solids from shape objects.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* [[File:Part_ReverseShape.svg|32px]] [[Part_ReverseShape|Reverse Shapes]]: Creates parametric copies with reversed face normals from selected objects.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* Copy:
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
:* [[File:Part_SimpleCopy.svg|32px]] [[Part_SimpleCopy|Simple Copy]]: Creates non-parametric copies of objects.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
:* [[File:Part_TransformedCopy.svg|32px]] [[Part_TransformedCopy|Transformed Copy]]: Creates non-parametric copies of objects. It is intended for objects nested in containers.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
:* [[File:Part_ElementCopy.svg|32px]] [[Part_ElementCopy|Shape Element Copy]]: Creates non-parametric copies of subelements: vertices, edges and faces.
</div> 

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
:* [[Image:Part_RefineShape.svg|32px]] [[Part_RefineShape|Refine Shape]]: Creates parametric copies with a refined shape from selected objects. It removes unnecessary edges from planar and cylindrical faces.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* [[Image:Part_ToleranceSet.svg|32px]] [[Part_ToleranceSet|Set Tolerance]]: creates a parametric copy of selected objects with all contained tolerances set to at least a certain minimum value. {{Version|1.1}}
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* [[Image:Part_SectionCut.svg|32px]] [[Part_SectionCut|Persistent Section Cut]]: Creates persistent cuts of objects and assemblies.
</div>

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
* [[Image:Part_EditAttachment.svg|32px]] [[Part_EditAttachment|Attachment]]: Attaches an object to one or more other objects.
</div>

